---
import kaiOsData from "../data/generated/kai-os-public-data.json";
import { PRODUCT_SYSTEMS } from "../data/product.js";
const { total_capabilities, capability_status_counts } = kaiOsData.agents;
---

<section class="agents" id="agents">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-center">
      <div class="section-badge">Specialized Intelligence</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Different systems. Clear boundaries.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">KAI is not one all-purpose autonomous agent. It coordinates domain systems with different maturity, permissions, and execution limits. Operational capability does not automatically mean independent autonomy.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="agents-grid">
      {PRODUCT_SYSTEMS.map((system) => (
        <article class="agent-card">
          <div class="agent-card-top"><span class="agent-icon" aria-hidden="true">{system.code}</span><span class={`status-badge ${system.tier}`}>{system.status}</span></div>
          <h3>{system.title}</h3><p>{system.description}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="agents-footer">
      <p>The technical registry currently declares <strong>{total_capabilities} agent roles</strong>: <strong>{capability_status_counts["Operational"] ?? 0} underlying capabilities operational</strong>, with planned roles kept visibly separate from working systems.</p>
      <a href="/agents" class="secondary-button">Review the Full Agent Registry</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.agents { background: radial-gradient(circle at 18% 18%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08), transparent 32%), linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-section), var(--bg-main)); }
.agents-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 22px; }
.agent-card { min-width: 0; min-height: 240px; padding: 28px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72), rgba(8, 17, 31, 0.72)); border: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease; }
.agent-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: var(--border-bright); }
.agent-card-top { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.agent-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 58px; height: 48px; border-radius: 7px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.22); color: var(--primary); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; }
.agent-card h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; }
.agent-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--text-soft); font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.75; }
.agents-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; margin-top: 40px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); }
.agents-footer p { max-width: 760px; margin: 0; color: var(--text-soft); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; }
.agents-footer strong { color: var(--text-main); }
.agents-footer .secondary-button { flex-shrink: 0; }
@media (max-width: 1050px) { .agents-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
@media (max-width: 750px) { .agents-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .agent-card { min-height: 0; } .agents-footer { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; } }
</style>
